# The PHY-validation scalar outputs are EVIDENCE for the physical-layer
# section of the report, not build artefacts: the claim audit checks for
# their presence and the negative control is reproducible from them.  They
# are therefore tracked, while the rest of the simulation output is not.
!Simulation/UAV_IoT_Demo/results/phy_validation_*.sca
!Simulation/UAV_IoT_Demo/results/phy_probe_*.sca

